  "body": "Presently, Synapse does not support HTTP range requests, which prevents users from seeking through audio/video media in many browsers. vector-im/element-web#2909 sought to fix this, though as that PR has been closed, I figured I should open another issue. This issue is the root cause of [matrix-org/riot-web#4265](https://github.com/vector-im/riot-web/issues/4265).\r\n",
